	(text "Astable 555, LEDs lit while OUT is LOW (discharge phase).\nt_on  = 0.693 * R2 * C1          = 83 ms\nt_off = 0.693 * (R1 + R2) * C1   = 776 ms\nf = 1.16 Hz, LED duty 9.7 %\nI_LED = (VCC - Vf - V_OL) / 3.3k = 0.4 mA @3.3 V ... 0.9 mA @5 V each"
